  "description": "The application site, situated on a corner plot with disused garage (to be demolished) access via the adjoining street is an end of terrace property with 4nº. studio flats on two floors. \n\nA Proposed two storey rear extension to form a one bed two person accommodation is to be erected. Existing Flat 01, on the ground floor is to have a rear single storey extension with patio door access to the rear. The disused outbuilding to  the rear is to be demolished to allow for rear amenity space. \n\nThe Materials and two storey extension are to be rendered and painted masonry to match the existing and is in keeping with the character of the street. In terms of tow storey extensions on the street, nº. 4 Wharncliffe Drive, has part two storey and part single storey extensions (as well as a loft, which this development does not have. Also, Brentvale drive has properties with two storey side/ rear extensions.\n",
